{"id":"10229cf1ace7edd3","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-gap-sentence.md","title":"相对于极小固定点的间隙句集","display":"df-gap-sentence — 相对于极小固定点的间隙句集","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-gap-sentence","aliases":["91-df-gap-sentence","91-df-gappy-sentence"],"display":"df-gap-sentence — 相对于极小固定点的间隙句集","depends_on":["[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","[[91-df-truth-value-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-gap-sentence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-gap-sentence</span><span>91-df-gappy-sentence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gap-sentence — 相对于极小固定点的间隙句集"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"460308c7099a8386\" href=\"?note=460308c7099a8386\" title=\"91-df-minimal-fixed-point\">91-df-minimal-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2bc1263010e83604\" href=\"?note=2bc1263010e83604\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-function\">91-df-truth-value-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\min}\">\\(X_{\\min}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"460308c7099a8386\" href=\"?note=460308c7099a8386\" title=\"91-df-minimal-fixed-point\">91-df-minimal-fixed-point</a> 的极小一致固定点；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_{X_{\\min}}\">\\(v_{X_{\\min}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2bc1263010e83604\" href=\"?note=2bc1263010e83604\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-function\">91-df-truth-value-function</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}\\)</span> 是下述句子集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gap}\">\\(\\mathrm{Gap}\\)</span> 表示信息间隙。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gap\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}:v_{X_{\\min}}(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u\\}\n=\\{\\varphi:\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin X_{\\min},\\ \\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin X_{\\min}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gap\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}:v_{X_{\\min}}(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u\\}\n=\\{\\varphi:\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin X_{\\min},\\ \\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin X_{\\min}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>集合等式使用固定点性质；对任意尚未闭合的信息集合不能直接替换递归求值为整句编码成员关系。说谎者与闭项真理陈述者均在此集合。\n“在极小固定点中有间隙”不等于“在所有一致固定点中都有间隙”；真理陈述者是反例。它也不等于经典闭包中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\neg\\varphi\\)</span> 都不成立。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemmas 15.7、15.13–15.14，印刷页 191、195–196，PDF 页 202、206–207。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"460308c7099a8386","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-value-function","status":"resolved","id":"2bc1263010e83604","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-value-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"460308c7099a8386","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X_{\\min}$ 是 [[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]] 的极小一致固定点；$v_{X_{\\min}}$ 见 [[91-df-truth-value-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-value-function","status":"resolved","id":"2bc1263010e83604","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X_{\\min}$ 是 [[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]] 的极小一致固定点；$v_{X_{\\min}}$ 见 [[91-df-truth-value-function]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X_{\\min}","display":false},{"tex":"v_{X_{\\min}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Gap}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gap\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}:v_{X_{\\min}}(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u\\}\n=\\{\\varphi:\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin X_{\\min},\\ \\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin X_{\\min}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":1401,"backlinks":[{"id":"965681a90864b053","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}$；\n$\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}$ 采用 [[91-df-gap-sentence]] 的句子集定义。"},{"id":"417cabd731eca511","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}$ 为 [[91-df-gap-sentence]] 的极小固定点间隙集。"},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-gap-sentence]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-66","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-gap-sentence]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-